# VF9-SRS and EPB-Park-Brake are each their OWN git repo (per-project change
# history is a real app feature — see docs/GIT-FEATURE.md). Git refuses to
# track a repo-inside-a-repo except as a gitlink/submodule, which would ship
# no actual content, so they are excluded entirely here and regenerated with
# `npm run sample:workspace` / `npm run sample` instead of being versioned by
# the app's own repo.
